{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35184","headline":"题金陵栖霞寺赠月公 · 周繇","name":"题金陵栖霞寺赠月公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明家不要买山钱，施作清池种白莲。\n松桧老依云外地，楼台深锁洞中天。\n风经绝顶回疎雨，石倚危屏挂落泉。\n欲结茅庵伴师住，肯饶多少薜萝烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}